# Firewall of booking (internal 172.28.2.20, data 172.28.3.20).
# Everything not listed here is dropped.
# direction  peer          port  rule name
in           172.28.2.10   8080  gateway-to-booking
out          172.28.3.40   5432  booking-to-postgres
out          172.28.3.41   5432  booking-to-postgres-standby
out          172.28.3.50   6379  booking-to-redis
out          172.28.3.61   5672  booking-to-rabbit1
out          172.28.3.62   5672  booking-to-rabbit2
out          172.28.3.63   5672  booking-to-rabbit3
